  "claims": [
    {
      "text": "When Duke Long contends for Dragon Palace, he says Eastern Sea’s righteous path is finally making a move. Song Qi Yuan, Qing Yue An, Hua Cai Yun, and further righteous path rank eights appear in sequence, and Fang Yuan reads their arrival as proof that Eastern Sea’s righteous path has already discussed and decided. Narration adds that Eastern Sea is the richest of the five regions in resources and thus has the highest number of rank eight Gu Immortals.",
      "chapters": [
        1690
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "dragon-palace-contest",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_duke_long",
        "house_dragon_palace",
        "char_song_qi_yuan",
        "char_qing_yue_an",
        "char_hua_cai_yun",
        "char_fang_yuan",
        "reg_eastern_sea",
        "sys_gu_immortal"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "At the qi sea banquet, speakers weigh whether Qi Sea Ancestor and Eastern Sea righteous path members will act against Drowning Uncle for openly selling a blood path Immortal Gu.",
      "chapters": [
        1885
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "qi-sea-banquet",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_qi_sea_ancestor",
        "sys_immortal_gu"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Wu Yong later calls Qi Sea Ancestor the undisputed leader of the current Eastern Sea righteous path, a qi path expert who stays in qi sea.",
      "chapters": [
        2000
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "named-leader",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_wu_yong"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "After Fang Yuan’s pressure, Qi Sea Ancestor’s refusal to resist leaves Eastern Sea’s righteous path without the will to fight him, and the Eastern Sea righteous path Gu Immortals answer with complicated silence while he claims contact with Heavenly Court. Narration also calls Qi Sea Ancestor a lone cultivator who sided with the righteous path.",
      "chapters": [
        2073
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "extortion-and-heavenly-court",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "fac_heavenly_court"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Forced by Fang Yuan’s variant human alliance, Eastern Sea’s super forces later appoint Qi Sea Ancestor alliance leader of Eastern Sea’s Righteous Qi Alliance.",
      "chapters": [
        2074
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "qi-sea-ancestor-named-alliance-leader",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    },
    {
      "text": "That named alliance is the formal union built from these righteous path clans. See Righteous Qi Alliance.",
      "chapters": [],
      "certainty": "inferred",
      "confidence": "C",
      "verification": "no_citation",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "qi-sea-ancestor-named-alliance-leader",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "fac_righteous_qi_alliance"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Qi Sea Ancestor sits the main seat with representatives of Eastern Sea righteous path forces beside him. Most Righteous Qi Alliance members are Eastern Sea righteous path super clans, and Fang Yuan’s lingering poisonous ant plague forces those righteous path forces to reveal hidden true inheritances to research a restraint.",
      "chapters": [
        2137
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "ant-plague-and-seats",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    }
  ],
